<div data-numbers="green">
    <h3><span class="h4">Everpure and Manitowoc Ice Honored with Kitchen Innovations Awards<br />
</span></h3>
<p>Everpure and Manitowoc Ice from Pentair Water Solutions have each won a 2025 Kitchen Innovations Award from the National Restaurant Association.</p>
<p>Everpure’s (PFOA/PFOS) Reduction Systems were awarded for their ability to reduce PFAS (PFOA/PFOS), or “forever chemicals”, in water. Manitowoc Ice was recognized for its innovative NEO ice machine, the industry&#39;s pioneering commercial undercounter ice machine that comes equipped with an integrated water filtration system.<br />
</p>
<p><a href="https://www.pentair.com/en-us/about-pentair/newsroom/blog/pentair-receives-kitchen-innovations-awards-for-everpure-and-manitowoc.html"><span class="text-arrow-link">Get the Details</span></a></p>

